\title{Solving recurrences}
\date{2026-03-19T19:27:30Z}
\tag{discrete}
\tag{draft}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{In many situations, it is easy to write down a recurrence relation, but what we really want is a closed form. How can we figure out a closed form for a given recurrence? There are many techniques, but the simplest is to “unfold” the recurrence and look for a pattern.}

